# ── Tracked scope ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Only the entries re-included below are tracked here. Anything else at the
# top level is local-only work and is ignored by default, so a new directory
# has to be added deliberately rather than swept up by `git add -A`.
/*
!/.github/
!/.gitignore
!/CLAUDE.md
!/README.md
!/download-attachments.mjs
!/download-entity-attachments.sh
!/HostedOneSDK V2/
!/KYB POC V1 ACME/
!/KYB V2 ACME/

